text = "1. Click HANDLE (umber strip on left edge) -> panel slides in (Pattern P2 : Tween3D analogue on SubViewportContainer.position).
2. Once open, click a PERSONA (olive / cream / rust cube) -> a yellow proxy cube travels to the [mission slot] dark cube (Pattern P3 : drag-drop = proxy + state event, no re-parenting).
3. After drop : the persona Label3D gains [mission] suffix ; the persona cube DOES NOT move (NPC autonomy).
4. Click 'OPEN OTHER LAYER' -> auto-rabat fires, panel slides closed (Pattern P4).
5. Watch the Output panel for [CANARY OK] / [CANARY FAIL] -- 7 invariants self-checked at _Ready (SubViewport-flavoured)."
